  "description": {
    "en": "The Dark-eyed Junco is a small, highly variable North American sparrow. Its regional forms range from smooth slate gray to brown-backed and hooded, but a small pale bill and white outer tail feathers unite them. Many northern and mountain birds move south or downhill in winter, when flocks often visit gardens and feeders.",
    "zh": "暗眼灯草鹀是一种体型较小、外观地域变化很大的北美雀鸟。不同地区的类型可呈纯净石板灰色、棕背色或深色头罩，但都具有小而浅色的喙和白色外侧尾羽。许多北方及山地个体冬季会南迁或下移，此时常成群出现在花园和喂鸟器附近。"
  },
  "encyclopedia": {
    "anatomy": {
      "en": "Adults are about 14–16 cm long, weigh 18–30 g, and span 18–25 cm across the wings. They have a rounded head, a short stout pale pinkish bill, and a fairly long tail whose white outer feathers flash in flight. Plumage differs strikingly among regional forms.",
      "zh": "成鸟体长约14至16厘米，体重18至30克，翼展18至25厘米。它们头部圆润，喙短粗、呈浅粉色，尾巴较长，飞行时白色外侧尾羽会明显闪现。不同地域类型的羽色差异十分显著。",
      "source_keys": [
        "identification"
      ]
    },
    "ecology_and_behavior": {
      "en": "Juncos hop and scratch through leaf litter for seeds and insects. Seeds make up most of the annual diet, while beetles, caterpillars, ants, wasps, flies and other insects become especially important in the breeding season. Males defend territories in summer; winter birds gather in flocks with recognizable dominance ranks.",
      "zh": "暗眼灯草鹀会在落叶层中跳跃、刨抓，寻找种子和昆虫。种子构成全年食物的大部分，而甲虫、毛虫、蚂蚁、黄蜂、苍蝇等昆虫在繁殖季尤其重要。雄鸟夏季保卫领地；冬季则结群，并形成可辨认的等级秩序。",
      "source_keys": [
        "life_history"
      ]
    },
    "habitat_and_distribution": {
      "en": "The species occurs across North America from Alaska and Canada south through the United States into Mexico. It breeds mainly in coniferous and mixed forests, including mountain forests, and in winter also uses open woods, fields, roadsides, parks and backyards. The map polygons show the documented range within the conterminous United States; the species' full range extends beyond them.",
      "zh": "本种广布北美，从阿拉斯加和加拿大向南，经美国延伸至墨西哥。它主要在针叶林和混交林（包括山地森林）繁殖，冬季也利用疏林、田野、路边、公园和庭院。地图多边形显示美国本土有记录的范围；本种完整分布还延伸到这些范围之外。",
      "source_keys": [
        "range",
        "range_geometry"
      ]
    }
  },
